<title>FINLAND: Silja Jan-March passenger volume up 6 pct.</title>
<headline>Silja Jan-March passenger volume up 6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish passenger ferry operator Silja Oy Ab said in a statement on Thursday the number of passengers carried in January-March by its Baltic Sea operator Silja Line rose six percent year-on-year 1.29 million.  </p>
<p>It gave the following figures:</p>
<p> Passenger volume		   Jan-March 97    Jan-March 96</p>
<p> Helsinki-Stockholm		   319,764	  281,687</p>
<p> Turku-Stockholm			469,809	  439,014</p>
<p> Vaasa traffic			  115,942	   96,573</p>
<p> Helsinki-Tallinn		     322,868	  342,143</p>
<p> Helsinki-Travemunde		   47,784	   41,151</p>
<p> TOTAL passengers		   1,286,812	1,210,117</p>
<p> TOTAL Cargo units		     33,066	   32,754</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
